    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "4000mg? that seems like a lot... but i guess if i'm in this much pain it makes sense. is there any risk if i go a little over that if the pain doesnt go away? i really can't afford to be limping tomorrow. also is it safe to take it with some ibuprofen to make it work better?",
